# The Databricks plug's client side, for episode images built with
# `--warehouse-clients databricks` (Dockerfile ALKERA_WAREHOUSE_CLIENTS).
# Compiled here, NOT in pyproject/uv.lock, for the reason snowflake-clients.in
# gives: a vendor adapter's caps must not hold back every image. Constrained to
# the base, native and ds locks, so every package it shares with them is the
# same version. Regenerate with the command in requirements-databricks.lock's
# header.
#
# All three are Apache-2.0. The Databricks CLI is NOT here: its licence (the
# "Databricks License") permits use "solely for the purposes of using the
# Licensed Materials within or connecting to the Databricks Services", which a
# local fake is not (docs/environments/DATABRICKS_SPIKE.md).
databricks-sdk
databricks-sql-connector
